oO2i4eNOiB5MkE2", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › PeriscopeFilm"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/movies"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/Busan%20Port"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/QF4OCzIor4S5rHJoO2i4eNOiB5MkE2/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "기관 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Encyclopedia Britannica (:41) presents \"That War in Korea\", a documentary about the Korean War of 1950 to 1953. Originally produced as a Project XX documentary. The film opens with USS Pickaway (:55). Pickaway shuttled US troops from Japan to Pusan. US soldiers bid wives and families goodbye at the start of the war (1:02). Wounded are drug across land (1:47). A funeral service follows (1:57). Rich", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-23T03:01:45Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-23T03:15:42Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"]}}, {"@id": "https://www.koreanwar.or.kr:8443/searchDetail.do?archRfcd=1990-US-01-PF-A-00046", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "흥남철수작전 당시 대기 중인 유엔군 군함들 사진 2", "rico:identifier": "1990-US-01-PF-A-00046", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "1950-12-10", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:koreanwar:협약 › 기증 > 미국 > 해군 > 군사감실"}, "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://korea-archive-mcp.vercel.app/iiif/rec/dVBNSwJRFP0rl7f2je-No-RARhCto49VtBgcQ7EcGydmEYHJLARbKCUJqcxCy4XRIAkW9Gdazrv-h-60qFWLy7n3Hs7h3HvFGsw8ZlXHLVk133LZSYp5zGTr0VS1ZrgIsT3AcQ_DAFTnHTtDULfNeBUBTno4WgEOQ3y4j5cRUK37M3U3AWzN8TkAnaWYTVYynxVc6lwKWlR-FnnBjw64kHxvl29zIYSRI-6SuLLn1RtmOu37vvYbSnNcreqaG4aRSTdKllss75Q8q3Km2c5WMu2fFu3N_1zryTWDHvY_4av5AZQdn0ZQAPW6ipcv1Kz7b0n-QnIBRY-jLnYmJKyR8O8vKXZOM8EFgYqG8WIOqh1geAP42MXxlCgr-Zwu9ByXkuuZQ5ExhTSNLLv-Bg/manifest